exts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Meeting People in the Workplace"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In the workplace, you will need to deal with people on a daily basis. You will meet and greet co-workers frequently and at times you will develop relationships with them. Your relationships with your co-workers are the foundation of your working life. <br/><br/>Here are some expressions you can use to meet and greet co-workers as well as to ask and answer questions. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Saying Hello\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Asking Someone How They Are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responding \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Hi Mark!<br/> Hello Mark!<br/> Hey Mark!<br/></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How are you?<br/> How are things?<br/> How are you doing?<br/> How have you been?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Good, thanks!<br/>  Not bad! <br/> Alright, thanks!<br/> All is well! <br/> I'm good!<br/>  I'm OK!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Returning the Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Other Things You Can Say\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  And you? <br/> You?<br/> How about you?<br/> What about you?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"    <span class=\\\"italic\\\">What a pleasure to (finally) meet you!<br/> It's good to see you again!<br/> It's been a long time, hasn't it?<br/> I have heard many things about you!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">NOTE</span>: In some cultures, it is common to talk about your families in the workplace. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Finding Out about Someone's Work Background"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you meet and greet co-workers, you may also ask them about their previous experiences. When asking about their work experiences,"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span>,  <span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous</span> or   <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tenses to ask questions. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Simple Past</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Past Continuous </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Present Perfect</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Did you ... ?<br/>  Were you ... ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Were + you + verb-ing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Have you ever + past participle ... ?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What were your areas of responsibilities?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Were you working from home?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Have you ever developed a budget?"}]