pe": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn7le04ob05re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn7le04ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn7le04ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn7le04ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Mr. Fontana - what a pleasure to meet you!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Just Rocco is fine, Ferdinand. Young man, I've heard many good things about you. How have you been? I hear your parents are back in the homeland.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: You heard right. They're in Sao Paulo and I'm already lonesome!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: I sympathize. My daughter has recently moved to Milan. I miss her and my grandson dreadfully.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: How many children have you got?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: One daughter, one grandchild. And you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I have a niece who is like a daughter. She's been with me since her graduation. All our extended family is in Brazil."}, {"time": "35000", "image": "engenn7le04ob05re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: You were a public relations manager there, weren't you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I was. For a high-end condominium project in Rio de Janeiro.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: What were your areas of responsibility?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Communications, publicity, promotion and press agentry.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Did you work with public relations?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Not directly. I did however have some involvement with public affairs."}, {"time": "57000", "image": "engenn7le04ob05re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Excellent. What kind of financial restrictions were you working within?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Finance was not my area.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Have you ever developed a budget plan?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: No. I'd propose an event, make a presentation and wait for the yea or nay. There was plenty of external funding.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Something we don't have.  Well, I see why we have been paired together. It will be my yea or nay from now on, Ferdinand!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}